  "status": "present",
  "value": "prices is a list of [time, price] pairs in any order; times are distinct non-negative integers and prices are positive integers. Each pair falls in the interval starting at time - time mod 10. For every interval that contains at least one pair, produce [start, highest price, lowest price, price at the earliest time, price at the latest time]. Return the candlesticks ordered by start.",
